- `g++ -fsyntax-only` on [RoutingService.cpp](qml/services/RoutingService.cpp) with the exact flags from `build/compile_commands.json`: exit 0, no diagnostics.
- `qmllint` on [RoutingScreen.qml](qml/screens/settings/RoutingScreen.qml): no syntax errors.
- No build, launch or unit tests — as you asked. So the wire-level behaviour (several wires into one card, click-to-show, unwire-one-of-many) is reasoned and type-checked but not seen running; that needs your build.

