- [CompositorState.hpp](src/PresentationEngine/modules/include/modules/presentation/CompositorState.hpp#L150): `TemplateWindowPlaneKey(bus, windowIndex)` — one compositor plane per *fallback* window, in its own key space so it can never collide with a real bus number.
