## Spec open questions — what I chose
Cameras fill windows **in route order** unless a window names its own bus (then that wins). An empty window shows the **design background** (no plane). Template edits: added windows get a slot with no feed, removed windows drop theirs. A deleted template **detaches** the bus (empty blocks → falls back to the program picture) rather than blocking the delete. Audio belongs to the **bus as a whole**, not per window.

